Superstar Speeders:
[[File:SuperstarSpeeders.png|200px|right]]'''Superstar Speeders''' is a series of 1/64 scale cartoonish-style Hot Wheels cars; it acts as the replacement for [[Hot Wheels RacerVerse]]. These cars put characters from various film and television properties into Hot Wheels original designs. All vehicles were designed by [[David Doern]], while the figures were designed by [[Mike Vasquez]] and [[Jesse Ornelas]].

